OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and scattered showers in the
OL,7,Fevening. Largely cloud overnight with
OL,8,Ffurther showers, these most frequent
OL,9,Facross Orkney with Shetland seeing
OL,10,Fsome clear spells. Winds becoming
OL,11,Flight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FRather cloudy with bright
OL,14,Fintervals and a few showers. Still
OL,15,Ffeeling rather cool with a light
OL,16,Fnorthwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
