OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMainly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells on Monday then
OL,7,Frain or showers on Tuesday and
OL,8,FWednesday. Staying quite cool for the
OL,9,Ftime of year.
